Quest Rescue The Grunts Grunt Selected
    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        (QuestRescueGrunts is discovered) Equal to True
        (QuestRescueGrunts is completed) Equal to False
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Grunt (Upsidedown)
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Distance between (Position of (Triggering unit)) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 250.00
                (Distance between (Position of (Triggering unit)) and (Position of Zulkis)) Less than or equal to 250.00
        UpsideGruntsRescuedInt Less than 3
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt_Index = (UpsideGrunt_Index + 1)
        Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt[UpsideGrunt_Index] = (Triggering unit)
        -------- Dead orc --------
        Set VariableSet UpsideGruntChance = (Random integer number between 1 and 2)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                UpsideGruntChance Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Sound - Play WaterSplash <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to UpsideGrunt[UpsideGrunt_Index]
                Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the origin of (Triggering unit) using war3campImported\Water_Effect.mdx
                Set VariableSet UpsideGruntEffect = (Last created special effect)
                Wait 0.50 seconds
                Unit - Hide UpsideGrunt[UpsideGrunt_Index]
                -------- Unhide Loop --------
                Set VariableSet UpsideGrunt_Counter[UpsideGrunt_Index] = 0
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        UpsideGrunt_Index Greater than or equal to 1
                    Then - Actions
                        Trigger - Turn on Quest Rescue The Grunts Grunt Unhide Loop <gen>
                    Else - Actions
                -------- Unhide loop ends --------
                Special Effect - Destroy UpsideGruntEffect
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of UpsideGrunt[UpsideGrunt_Index])
                Unit - Create 1 Grunt for Player 2 (Blue) at VarPoint facing (Random angle) degrees
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Unit - Kill (Last created unit)
                Floating Text - Create floating text that reads Grunt has drowned! above (Last created unit) with Z offset 25.00, using font size 13.00, color (100.00%, 5.00%, 10.00%), and 0.00% transparency
                Floating Text - Set the velocity of (Last created floating text) to 75.00 towards 90.00 degrees
                Floating Text - Change (Last created floating text): Disable permanence
                Floating Text - Change the lifespan of (Last created floating text) to 3.50 seconds
                Floating Text - Change the fading age of (Last created floating text) to 1.40 seconds
                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
                Skip remaining actions
            Else - Actions
